@startuml
title cti-expert v2.12 — /cti and /case: the recursive spider-map pipeline (AEAD)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam ArrowColor #34495E
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #EAF2FB
  BorderColor #2C6FBB
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FFF3D6
  DiamondBorderColor #C8901F
  StartColor #2C6FBB
  EndColor #2C6FBB
}

start
:**/cti TARGET**   (single entry point)\n//or// **/case TARGET**  ·  **/cti-case CASE-ID seed…**;
:**route by target type**\ndomain · URL · IP · email · username\nphone · wallet · hash · APK / binary;

partition "**STEP 0 — RECALL**  (cheapest call in the toolkit)" {
  :**/cti-recall SEED**   →   which_cases · kb_entity;
  note right
    "Have I seen this before?"
    Checks the seed against **every prior case**
    before a single credit is spent.
    Already attributed  ->  reuse, don't re-collect.
  end note
}

partition "**ACQUIRE**  (collect raw data)" {
  if (target is a domain / URL?) then (yes)
    :/sweep · /query · /subdomain · /github-osint\n/threat-check · /scam-check · /dork-sweep\n//subdomain_enum: subfinder (keyed from .env) · amass · assetfinder · findomain -> live names join the next round//;
    :**/webpivot**  — web-infra pivoting\nfavicon mmh3 · GA/GTM/AdSense · wallets\nemails · phones · Telegram · SaaS tokens · WHOIS\n(+ /cert-pivot · /sensitive-paths · /email-hygiene);
    :**/webpivot ~--harvest**\nfull Wayback history  ->  first-seen / last-seen selectors;
    :**/icp**   ICP filing (工信部备案)  ->  PRC entity + licence serial\n//licence serial reverses to every sibling domain//;
    note right
      Runs **keyless by default**
      (crt.sh CT · passive DNS · anonymous urlscan).
      **Auto-upgrades** when premium keys are set via
      /apikeys — see workflow-apikeys.
      Hostile infra  ->  **~--passive**, no live contact.
    end note
  elseif (target is a file / APK / exe?) then (yes)
    :**/binary**  — BinaryPivot static IOC extraction\nAPK signing-cert SHA-256 · package name · permissions\nembedded C2 / backend hosts · Firebase · S3 · wallets;
    :**/hash-id**  ->  file hash or credential material?\nthen ANY.RUN **TI Lookup** //(read-only)//\n//detonation (anyrun_submit) is ask-first, private-only, plan-checked//;
  else (username / email / phone / person)
    :/username · /email-deep · /phone · /breach-deep\n/stealer-log · /saas-map · /msft-recon;
    note right: **/webpivot is NOT run**\nfor non-web targets
  endif

  :**/cn-corp**  on any company name / USCC found\nGSXT -> TianYanCha / QCC / Aiqicha -> 信用中国;
  :**/iban**  on any payment detail found\nISO 7064 mod-97 · BBAN split · jurisdiction mismatch;
}

partition "**ENRICH**  (expand leads — recursive)" {
  :/branch · /crossref · /rank-relations · /pivot-suggest\n/crypto-balance · /link-subjects · /signatures;
  :**/cti-check INDICATOR**  — false-positive control\nBENIGN (shared noise) vs SIGNAL (operator link);
  note right
    A false **merge** names an innocent party.
    A false **split** loses the case.
    Screen every indicator *before* clustering.
  end note
  :**kb_ingest**  ->  shared knowledge base;
  :**/cti-cluster**  — peers · shared indicators\nTLS/SAN overlap · reverse-WHOIS\n**MO-neighbours** — origin-IP co-tenants, WHOIS-verified\n//only a registrant join-key ever seeds; same-MO personas stay a rung-10 table//;
}

repeat :**spider-map**  — every new identifier becomes a seed;
  :confidence gate  —  exact-match links auto-pursue,\nweak / PII links held;
  :dedup + depth cap  ·  per-depth checkpoint;
repeat while (frontier exhausted?) is (no — new seeds) not (yes)
note right
  **autonomy = auto** (default).
  Expands **to closure with no approval prompts** —
  the confidence gate, not a human, keeps it tight.
  Narrow with ~--checkpoint · ~--depth N · ~--reach focused
end note

partition "**ASSESS**  (score + verify)" {
  :/risk  — NRD · bulletproof hosting · money-trail flags;
  :/exposure · /validate · /coverage //(+ 5W1H pass)//;
  :**/threat-model**  — requires an **ACH matrix**:\nrival hypotheses scored by //inconsistency//, runner-up named;
  :**ICD-203 judgment**  — likelihood band + evidence confidence\n//almost no chance// … //almost certain//;
}

partition "**DELIVER**  (package output)" {
  :**/cti-report CASE-ID**\n~--graph  ->  IntelGraph relationship render (PNG/SVG/Mermaid)\n**house report**  ->  editorial PDF/DOCX composed from the case dir\n//charts · landing-page captures (web-scan / web-archive stand-ins) · dossiers · Appendices A–E//;
  :/report · /brief · /render;
  if (sharing outside the org?) then (yes — **opt-in**)
    :**/redact**  ->  stable [EMAIL_1] placeholders\n+ reversible JSON map;
  else (no)
  endif
  :always save  .md + .json + .csv + IOC bundle (STIX 2.1 · JSONL)\nthen ASK presentation: (a) PDF · (b) DOCX · (c) HTML · (d) all\n//HTML: confirm the Blueprint mode first — Auto (apex-level fold) · force · off · skip (~--yolo keeps Auto)//;
}
stop

legend right
  **Keyless / free by default**
  ====
  Every phase works with **no API keys**.
  Premium keys (/apikeys) only *upgrade*
  Acquire + Enrich — they never gate the pipeline.
  ----
  **Two separate cost ledgers**
  Anthropic model spend  ->  /cost
  Third-party API credits ->  api_usage
  //They are never the same number.//
  ----
  **/cti-status** — backend tier · MCP tools · credit balances
endlegend
@enduml
